div
	.modal-header
		h2.modal-title.h5 Settings
	.modal-body
		h3.h6 TypeRelay keyboard
		p Enable TypeRelay in keyboard settings. When typing, switch to TypeRelay, select a snippet, then switch back.
		p On iOS, Full Access is not required. Some apps and secure fields do not allow third-party keyboards.
		button#keyboard-settings.btn.btn-outline-primary.btn-sm.mb-3(type="button") Open keyboard settings
		h3.h6 Sync
		p= server || 'Not signed in'
		p The keyboard uses the last local snapshot. Open TypeRelay to receive changes from other devices.
		button#reconnect.btn.btn-outline-primary.btn-sm.me-3(type="button" disabled=!server) Reconnect account
		button#logout.btn.btn-outline-danger.btn-sm(type="button" disabled=!server) Sign out
	.modal-footer
		button.btn.btn-outline-secondary.btn-sm(type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal") Close
